  "notes": "{願|ねが}う is a godan verb meaning to wish for or to request.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{願|ねが}う\n\nSENSE 1 (to wish for):\n- ⟦{幸|しあわ}せ→幸せ：01420_shiawase⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{願|ねが}う: to wish for happiness\n- ⟦{成功|せいこう}→成功：02638_seikou⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{願|ねが}う: to wish for success\n- ⟦{平和|へいわ}→平和：01507_heiwa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{願|ねが}う: to wish for peace\n\nSENSE 2 (to request):\n- ⟦お{願|ねが}い→お願い：10299_onegai⟧⟦します→する：00392_suru⟧: please (standard polite request)\n- ⟦お{願|ねが}い→お願い：10299_onegai⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧⟦あります→ある：00006_aru⟧: I have a request\n- ～{願|ねが}えます⟦か→か：09473_ka⟧: Could you please ~?\n- ⟦よろしく→よろしく：01070_yoroshiku⟧⟦お{願|ねが}い→お願い：10299_onegai⟧⟦します→する：00392_suru⟧: Thank you in advance / Nice to meet you\n\nFORMAL/LITERARY:\n- {願|ねが}わく⟦は→は：00079_ha⟧: I wish that... (literary)\n- {願|ねが}って⟦も→も：00484_mo⟧⟦ない→ない：01118_nai⟧: couldn't wish for more\n\nFORMS:\n- ⟦{願|ねが}い→願い：03529_negai⟧: wish, request\n- ⟦{願|ねが}い→願い：03529_negai⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{叶|かな}える→叶える：11807_kanaeru⟧: to grant a wish\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{願書|がんしょ}→願書：16223_gansho⟧: application form\n- ⟦{志願|しがん}→志願：12669_shigan⟧: volunteering, aspiration\n- ⟦{祈願|きがん}→祈願：13745_kigan⟧: prayer, supplication",
